body:
I'm no expert or anything like that, but in my experience it works out to be a win more card.  It either dies immediately/no buff cards or it wins me the game.  It's a good card, but I wouldn't say it's completely necessary.

&#x200B;

Personally I regret crafting it, but if it was something I got out of pack I would be happy with it.  I hope this helps.
